[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4680.709, "timestamp": "01:18:00", "text": "你想去哪儿就去哪儿，直接走就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4683.669, "timestamp": "01:18:03", "text": "乘坐地铁，然后你就会看到线路了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4685.91, "timestamp": "01:18:05", "text": "然后你就走上去，然后你就看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4687.99, "timestamp": "01:18:07", "text": "它在那里。好的。所以这很容易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4689.59, "timestamp": "01:18:09", "text": "因为我从小就没有接触过本地文化。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4690.95, "timestamp": "01:18:10", "text": "趋势。所以我还是搞不明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4693.189, "timestamp": "01:18:13", "text": "当地趋势等等，但如果我能弄清楚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4695.43, "timestamp": "01:18:15", "text": "你很容易就能弄明白。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4697.03, "timestamp": "01:18:17", "text": "不用担心。确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4699.03, "timestamp": "01:18:19", "text": "看起来很复杂，但一旦掌握了就很容易了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4701.51, "timestamp": "01:18:21", "text": "你需要一天时间来适应。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4704.31, "timestamp": "01:18:24", "text": "同时还能拿到一张卡。去办张卡。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4707.03, "timestamp": "01:18:27", "text": "它花了你500日元。我觉得我有那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4709.189, "timestamp": "01:18:29", "text": "我现在随身带着这张卡。你，这要花多少钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4711.83, "timestamp": "01:18:31", "text": "你500日元。你也可以像这样写"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4712.174, "timestamp": "01:18:32", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "am back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4714.55, "timestamp": "01:18:34", "text": "往里面放点钱，比如5000日元之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4716.79, "timestamp": "01:18:36", "text": "你甚至可以用那张卡去购物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4718.709, "timestamp": "01:18:38", "text": "比如从自动售货机买，或者你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4720.709, "timestamp": "01:18:40", "text": "像在其他任何公司一样购买。所以是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4721.1, "timestamp": "01:18:41", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hi orange"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4723.11, "timestamp": "01:18:43", "text": "它就像一台自动取款机，但它不是，你不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4724.63, "timestamp": "01:18:44", "text": "撤回它。你可以直接把钱投进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4726.87, "timestamp": "01:18:46", "text": "它。所以这并不复杂。不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4728.709, "timestamp": "01:18:48", "text": "如果我能想清楚，我会告诉人们如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4730.229, "timestamp": "01:18:50", "text": "我能搞定，你也能搞定。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4731.574, "timestamp": "01:18:51", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "get the blue eyes white dragon card"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4732.31, "timestamp": "01:18:52", "text": "出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4733.95, "timestamp": "01:18:53", "text": "我是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4736.118, "timestamp": "01:18:56", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "heyoo pravin"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4736.55, "timestamp": "01:18:56", "text": "抱歉，你们知道，如果你们不……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4738.709, "timestamp": "01:18:58", "text": "我知道每当我……的时候，我都会感到非常焦虑。"}]